        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/5",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "text": "鐵諾,你果然很耐命!怪不得頭子一定要我親自來看看....不過,你的好運也到此為止了!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/6",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "text": "如果不是這些年輕人幫忙的話,我早就沒命了!不過既然我還活著,我還是要問你一個問題:到底是誰命令你來殺我?"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/7",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "text": "告訴你也不要緊,是葛雷大人命令我們來除掉你的!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/8",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "text": "葛雷?那個心胸狹窄的禁衛軍統領?是為了三年前爭奪卡蘿那女孩的事吧!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/9",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "text": "妳..妳怎麼會知道這件事?"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/10",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "text": "秘密!不過你可以放心,我們都會幫你的。"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/829350ab70eb/events/1/11",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "text": "可惡!幫他的都得死,何況你們已經知道了這個秘密,那就別怪我不留情!給我殺!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "event_id": "legacy/event/829350ab70eb/events/1",
